PyOtherSide is a QML Plugin for Qt 5 and Qt 6 that provides access
to a Python 3 interpreter from QML, allowing to create asynchronous
mobile and Desktop UIs with Python.

At its core, PyOtherSide is basically a simple layer that converts
Qt (QML) objects to Python objects and vice versa, with focus on
asynchronous events and continuation-passing style function calls.
